{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>הורד</b> Two times in the Masorah: ויוסף הורד · הורד שאול. To teach that exile is weighed against Gehinnom." "<b>הורידוהו</b> Two times in the Masorah: הורידוהו שמה · הורידוהו אלי. Regarding Benjamin. Because Yehudah caused Yosef to be brought down there to Egypt, he too had to bring Benjamin down there."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {0 "The second occurrence, הורד שאול, is 1 Samuel 28:3."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:02.192012344Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}